        "runId": "ada-en-20261107-eab366ae-e542-49a4-8e67-bf54cf3f8a2d",
        "model": "ChatGPT"
      },
      "text": "New Year departure: a net supplement of $250 per person, including New Year’s dinner and service."
    },
    {
      "blockId": "tour:note:ba762eb5cd201f15",
      "field": "note",
      "sourceTextSha256": "58d1b4690c72a621b574049722102977e9c2ad392746c13b28e4815083b3d3d2",
      "provenance": {
        "kind": "ai_translation",
        "runId": "ada-en-20261107-eab366ae-e542-49a4-8e67-bf54cf3f8a2d",
        "model": "ChatGPT"
      },
      "text": "If necessary, we may substitute a similar hotel in the same category. The day-by-day itinerary shows accommodation for the 4★ package. See the accommodation table for hotels in the other packages."
    },
    {
      "blockId": "tour:note:713539a1f0e47331",
      "field": "note",
      "sourceTextSha256": "0ec039944bdaa17731efa0892d2991596660f9625854731644a01e2cdf75dbf2",
      "provenance": {
        "kind": "ai_translation",
        "runId": "ada-en-20261107-eab366ae-e542-49a4-8e67-bf54cf3f8a2d",
        "model": "ChatGPT"
      },
      "text": "The 5★ rates are lower than the 3★ and 4★ rates. The price and accommodation included in the 5★ package are confirmed before payment."
    },
    {
      "blockId": "tour:note:5758fc5a01c815c2",
      "field": "note",
      "sourceTextSha256": "d9c7d9371a46ea3897efa83e02e42b0440592ae59f5717c0130f043ae89141ba",
      "provenance": {
        "kind": "ai_translation",
        "runId": "ada-en-20261107-eab366ae-e542-49a4-8e67-bf54cf3f8a2d",
        "model": "ChatGPT"
      },
      "text": "The return flight from La Paz to Lima is part of the day-by-day itinerary. The departure airport and whether the return ticket is included are confirmed before payment."
    },
    {
      "blockId": "tour:note:3d977a384dd1cc04",
      "field": "note",
      "sourceTextSha256": "79767466d51b978e6e6166701660c99998de097316ed4235727edd44812be5a3",
      "provenance": {
        "kind": "ai_translation",
        "runId": "ada-en-20261107-eab366ae-e542-49a4-8e67-bf54cf3f8a2d",
        "model": "ChatGPT"
      },
      "text": "The order of visits to La Paz, the Valley of the Moon and Tiwanaku is arranged around the return flight."
    },
    {
      "blockId": "tour:note:95eed2c118cb16bf",
      "field": "note",
      "sourceTextSha256": "bc4354f0b6ff5835339eaa6505437a1b3f97a58c845fcd093d6039c36b5346af",
      "provenance": {
        "kind": "ai_translation",
        "runId": "ada-en-20261107-eab366ae-e542-49a4-8e67-bf54cf3f8a2d",
        "model": "ChatGPT"
      },
      "text": "You’ll need good stamina for the trip to Vinicunca, as the route reaches about 5,200 m."
